  "plan": "## Implementation Plan: Add Code Path to Board\n\n### 1. Config Storage Strategy (resolve global vs per-board ambiguity)\n\n**Decision: Hybrid approach**\n- `~/.mad/config.json` (global): Contains default settings and a `boards` object mapping board names to their configurations\n- Per-board config at `~/.mad/boards/<boardname>/config.json`: Inherits from global config, can override `code_path`\n- `code_path` field: Absolute path to the project root (e.g., `/home/user/myproject`)\n\n**Schema for `~/.mad/config.json`:**\n```json\n{\n  \"default_code_path\": \"/default/path\",\n  \"boards\": {\n    \"myboard\": {\n      \"code_path\": \"/specific/path\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. CONTEXT.md File Strategy\n\n- Location: `<project_root>/.mad/CONTEXT.md` (alongside board directory)\n- Alternative: `~/.mad/boards/<boardname>/CONTEXT.md`\n- Agent instruction prepending should reference: `{{code_path}}/.mad/CONTEXT.md` or `~/.mad/boards/<boardname>/CONTEXT.md`\n\n### 3. Agent Invocation Mechanism\n\n**Files to modify:**\n- `src/config/loader.ts` - Load and merge board configs\n- `src/agent/runner.ts` - Set working directory and prepend instructions\n- `src/agent/prompts.ts` - Add instruction template prefix\n\n**Implementation:**\n1. When agent starts, resolve `code_path`:\n   - Check per-board config first\n   - Fall back to global `default_code_path`\n   - Error if neither exists\n\n2. Set agent's working directory to `code_path` (not work item directory)\n\n3. Prepend to agent instructions:\n```\n--- PROJECT CONTEXT ---\nCode Path: /path/to/project\nContext File: /path/to/project/.mad/CONTEXT.md\n---------------------\n\n[existing instructions]\n```\n\n4. If CONTEXT.md exists, read its contents and include them after the header\n\n### 4. File Changes\n\n1. **config schema**: Add `code_path` and `context_file` fields\n2. **config loader**: Add `resolveBoardCodePath(boardName)` function\n3. **agent runner**: Modify to:\n   - Call `resolveBoardCodePath()` before starting agent\n   - Set `cwd` option to the resolved path\n   - Read CONTEXT.md if exists\n   - Prepend context header + content to agent messages\n4. **CLI new-board command**: Prompt for `code_path` when creating board\n5. **CLI config command**: Add `mad config set-code-path <board> <path>`\n\n### 5. Edge Cases\n\n- No `code_path` configured: Prompt user or error with helpful message\n- CONTEXT.md doesn't exist: Include path in header but note \"(not found)\"\n- Relative paths in `code_path`: Resolve to absolute before use\n- Multiple boards with same name in different locations: Use board-relative paths\n\n### 6. Testing\n\n- Unit tests for config resolution (global override, per-board override)\n- Integration tests for agent invocation with code_path\n- Test instruction prepending format and content"
